# The built Shell is copied here by scripts/build-shell-binary.sh.
#
# This file is tracked so the directory exists in a fresh clone: `go:embed`
# fails to compile against a missing directory, and a repository that does not
# compile until you have run a JavaScript build first is a bad first ten
# minutes for anybody.
#
# The binary does not treat an empty bundle as acceptable — it refuses to start
# with ErrNoIndex — so this placeholder cannot become a Shell that serves
# nothing.
